### Réserver une chambre
POST http://localhost:8080/api/reservations
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "hotelId": "IBIS-DAKAR",
  "roomNumber": "999",
  "guestEmail": "test@skystay.test",
  "startDate": "2026-12-01",
  "endDate": "2026-12-03"
}

### Consulter une réservation
GET http://localhost:8080/api/reservations/1

### Fermer un hôtel (batch, contourne la règle des 48h)
POST http://localhost:8080/api/admin/hotels/IBIS-DAKAR/close

